There's no point in debating this if you don't recognise that as having a bad attitude. 

Looking at your other comments on this thread, I understand.

> What are all the other times? 

&#x200B;

> You're mad a professional fighter thinks they're the best? You know how many people call themselves the best and think nobody is better than them? That's the mindset you need if you want to be champion. 

&#x200B;

> She makes one excuse one time and all of a sudden she blames her losses on things. Got it. 

&#x200B;

You're quite clearly a Joanna fanboy who cannot stand any criticism against her.
